              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SIBEDREAMZ"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a fun and yummy recipe to make for very picky kids and husbands!\r\nOne note...these make very large burgers...be ready to get full, but it is worth it!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tammy Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used celery salt instead of celery seed, because burgers always need some salt. I also added onion powder. I stuffed mine with American cheese, pickles and horseradish mustard. I sealed the patties up really well, but the condiments still leaked out all over the grill. They did taste good though.",
            "datePublished": "2024-07-24T02:36:14.720Z"
          },
