            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Navy_Mommy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A cute novelty idea. I probably won't make them again though. The meat itself had really no flavor and since everyone in my family eats something different on their burger it was too difficult to keep track of who's burger what who's.",
